      <h2><span><a name="publications"></a> <FONT COLOR=white FONT SIZE=4>Publications</FONT></span>    </h2>
      <p align="justify">
	
My research activity, mainly in dynamical systems, has gradually evolved, from the asymptotic analysis of ordinary differential 
equations (stability, bifurcations, chaos and strange attractors ...) with applications to electric oscillators, 1990-2000, 
to that of Delay-DE and PDE (from the dynamical system point of view), with ​​applications
 to life science, 2000-... .  Then (2006- ...) to complex systems and  interaction networks, essentially
the study of ODE or PDE systems, coupled according to different network/graph topologies,  modeling 
problems in neuroscience, ecosystems,
such as prey-predator systems, or epidemiology.

 
     
